    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="03240481-05f0-5e3d-83e7-cde1732549b5" activityNameId="23024574-d073-5fe8-9e9b-c00dba44d54b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Solar collector glass tube, with silver mirror, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Solar collector glass tube, with silver mirror, at plant
Production of solar collector tubes.;
Synonyms: glass evacuated tube, magnetron sputtering, Internal Circular Reflector, Vakuumröhrenkollektor; 
UUID: f139f84a-7878-3553-9bb2-d96081a8b80b
Gate to gate inventory for the manufacturing of collector tubes from glass tubes including a sputter coating with a selective coating and a mirror layer. Infrastructure considered for the pre-product.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Sputtering and coating of glass.
Time period: Data for a few month of production.
Production volume: 250 t/a.
Sampling: Questionnaire. 
Extrapolations: Partly based on estimations.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f139f84a-7878-3553-9bb2-d96081a8b80b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="948c6fdb-25b0-54ae-bf5c-e320176f724c" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
